"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">10</div><h1>화법조동사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Modalverben</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 10의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">화법조동사는 두 번째 자리, 원형은 문장 끝에 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">일곱 화법조동사를 주어에 맞게 활용해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">뜻에 따라 können·dürfen·müssen·sollen·wollen·mögen·möchten을 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">nicht müssen과 nicht dürfen, 본동사 없는 문장을 구별해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Mein Bruder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> sehr gut tanzen.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 형은 춤을 아주 잘 춰요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Bruder <b>kann</b> sehr gut tanzen.</div>화법조동사는 ich와 er의 모양이 같고 어미가 없어요 — er kann.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Müsst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> ihr heute Abend kochen?</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 오늘 저녁에 요리해야 해?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Müsst</b> ihr heute Abend kochen?</div>ihr는 원형의 어간으로 돌아와 -t를 붙여요 — ihr müsst.<br>Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 화법조동사가 맨 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;darfst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen)</span> hier nicht schwimmen. Das Wasser ist sehr tief.</div><div class=\"qko\">여기서 수영하면 안 돼. 물이 아주 깊어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>darfst</b> hier nicht schwimmen. Das Wasser ist sehr tief.</div>금지는 nicht dürfen이에요.<br>du는 모음이 바뀐 어간에 -st를 붙여요 — du darfst.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;will&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Lena <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wollen)</span> in Wien Musik studieren.</div><div class=\"qko\">레나는 빈에서 음악을 전공하려고 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lena <b>will</b> in Wien Musik studieren.</div>계획과 의지는 wollen이에요.<br>er·sie는 ich와 같은 will이고 어미가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Möchten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(möchten)</span> Sie noch etwas Wasser?</div><div class=\"qko\">물을 좀 더 드릴까요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Möchten</b> Sie noch etwas Wasser?</div>정중하게 원하는 것을 묻는 말은 möchten이에요.<br>Sie는 원형과 같은 möchten이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mag&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Mein Vater <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mögen)</span> keine Pilze.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 아버지는 버섯을 좋아하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Vater <b>mag</b> keine Pilze.</div>좋아하는 대상(명사)은 mögen으로 말해요.<br>er는 모음이 바뀌고 어미가 없어요 — er mag.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sollt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ihr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sollen)</span> jeden Tag zehn Wörter lernen. Das sagt Frau Kim.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희는 매일 단어 열 개를 외워야 해요. 김 선생님이 그렇게 말씀하세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ihr <b>sollt</b> jeden Tag zehn Wörter lernen. Das sagt Frau Kim.</div>다른 사람이 시킨 일은 sollen이에요.<br>sollen은 모음이 바뀌지 않아요 — ihr sollt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> '우리는 내일 조부모님을 찾아뵈어야 해요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir muss morgen unsere Großeltern besuchen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wir müssen morgen unsere Großeltern besuchen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir müssen morgen besuchen unsere Großeltern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir morgen müssen unsere Großeltern besuchen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">화법조동사는 두 번째 자리, 원형은 문장 맨 끝이에요.<br>wir에는 müssen을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Er <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gut Gitarre spielen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) können</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) kann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) kannt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) könnt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">er에도 어미 -t를 붙이지 않아요 — er kann.<br>könnt는 ihr의 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> '엄마가 나한테 방 청소하래요.'<br>Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mein Zimmer putzen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) darf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) will</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) soll</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mag</button></div><div class=\"qe\">다른 사람(엄마)이 시킨 일은 sollen이에요.<br>will은 내 의지, darf는 허락이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> (박물관 직원에게) '여기서 전화해도 되나요?'<br><span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich hier telefonieren?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Will</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Muss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Darf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Soll</button></div><div class=\"qe\">처음 보는 사람에게 허락을 구할 때는 Darf ich …?가 정중해요.<br>Soll ich …?는 '~⁠할까요?'라고 상대의 뜻을 묻는 말이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> '나는 요리하는 걸 좋아해요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich möchte kochen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich gern koche.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich koche gern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich mag gern kochen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">좋아하는 일은 동사 + gern으로 말해요. gern은 동사 바로 뒤에 와요.<br>Ich möchte kochen.은 '지금 요리하고 싶어요'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> '일요일에는 일하지 않아도 돼요.'<br>Am Sonntag <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich nicht arbeiten.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) muss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) darf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) soll</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) kann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'안 해도 된다'(필요 없음)는 nicht müssen이에요.<br>nicht dürfen은 '하면 안 된다'(금지)예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;darf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> In der Bibliothek <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen)</span> man nicht laut telefonieren.</div><div class=\"qko\">도서관에서는 큰 소리로 통화하면 안 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · In der Bibliothek <b>darf</b> man nicht laut telefonieren.</div>금지는 nicht dürfen이에요.<br>man은 er와 같은 형태를 써요 — man darf.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Kannst du heute meinem Sohn helfen?&quot;,&quot;Kannst du meinem Sohn heute helfen?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 내 아들 좀 도와줄 수 있어?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">meinem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Sohn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Kannst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">helfen?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">du</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Kannst du heute meinem Sohn helfen?</b></div>Ja/Nein 의문문은 화법조동사가 맨 앞, 원형 helfen이 맨 끝이에요.<br>helfen은 3격과 써요 — meinem Sohn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Meine Tochter kann noch nicht schwimmen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 딸은 아직 수영을 못 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">kann</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">schwimmen.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Tochter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">noch</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meine Tochter kann noch nicht schwimmen.</b></div>kann이 두 번째 자리, schwimmen이 맨 끝이에요.<br>noch nicht(아직 ~⁠않다)는 원형 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Kannst&quot;],[&quot;muss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> „<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> du am Samstag mit mir kommen?“ – „Nein, ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> leider arbeiten.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;토요일에 나랑 같이 갈 수 있어?&quot; – &quot;아니, 아쉽지만 일해야 해.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „<b>Kannst</b> du am Samstag mit mir kommen?“ – „Nein, ich <b>muss</b> leider arbeiten.“</div>du → kannst, ich → muss. 의문문에서는 화법조동사가 맨 앞에 와요.<br>본동사 kommen·arbeiten은 원형으로 끝에 둬요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> '나는 생선을 좋아하지 않아요. 오늘은 닭고기를 먹고 싶어요.'<br>Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> keinen Fisch. Heute <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich Hähnchen essen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) möchte … möchte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) mag … möchte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mag … mag</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) möchte … mag</button></div><div class=\"qe\">늘 좋아하는 대상은 mögen — Ich mag keinen Fisch.<br>지금 바라는 일은 möchte + 원형 — Heute möchte ich Hähnchen essen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;musst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Es ist schon elf Uhr. Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> nach Hause.</div><div class=\"qko\">벌써 11시야. 너는 집에 가야 해.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Es ist schon elf Uhr. Du <b>musst</b> nach Hause.</div>방향 표현(nach Hause)이 있으면 gehen을 빼고 말할 수 있어요.<br>du → musst.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 본동사를 뺀 문장 가운데 '그는 일본어를 할 줄 알아요'라는 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er mag Japanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er darf Japanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Er will Japanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Er kann Japanisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">언어와 함께 쓰는 können은 sprechen을 빼고 말해요 — Er kann Japanisch.<br>Er mag Japanisch.는 '일본어를 좋아해요'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dürft&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Oma schläft. Ihr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen)</span> jetzt nicht laut spielen.</div><div class=\"qko\">할머니가 주무셔. 너희 지금 시끄럽게 놀면 안 돼.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Oma schläft. Ihr <b>dürft</b> jetzt nicht laut spielen.</div>금지는 nicht dürfen이에요.<br>ihr는 원형의 어간으로 돌아와요 — ihr dürft.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wann müsst ihr nach Hause gehen?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희는 언제 집에 가야 해?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wann</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">gehen?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Hause</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">müsst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ihr</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wann müsst ihr nach Hause gehen?</b></div>W-의문문은 의문사 + 화법조동사 + 주어 순서예요.<br>원형 gehen은 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Morgen müssen wir lange warten.&quot;,&quot;Wir müssen morgen lange warten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 우리는 오래 기다려야 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">lange</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">warten.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">wir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Morgen müssen wir lange warten.</b></div>Morgen이 첫 자리에 오면 müssen이 두 번째, 주어 wir가 그 뒤예요.<br>원형 warten은 언제나 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> (아이가 떼를 쓰며) '나 지금 초콜릿 먹을래!'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich möchte jetzt Schokolade, bitte.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich soll jetzt Schokolade!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich will jetzt Schokolade!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich darf jetzt Schokolade!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">고집스러운 강한 의지는 wollen이에요.<br>möchte … bitte는 정중한 부탁이라서 떼쓰는 말투가 아니에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Meine Schwester will Pilotin werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Unser Hund mögt keine Katzen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Möchtet ihr etwas trinken?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Kann ich Ihnen etwas zeigen?</button></div><div class=\"qe\">unser Hund는 er와 같아서 mag이에요. mögt는 ihr의 형태예요.<br>Möchtet ihr …?는 ihr의 바른 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kann&quot;],[&quot;soll&quot;],[&quot;Kannst&quot;],[&quot;möchte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Am Samstag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> ich leider nicht kommen. Ich habe Fieber. Meine Ärztin sagt, ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(sollen)</span> zwei Tage zu Hause bleiben. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> du am Sonntag kommen? Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(möchten)</span> dir mein Fotoalbum zeigen.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에는 아쉽지만 못 가. 나 열이 나. 의사 선생님이 이틀 동안 집에 있으래. 일요일에 올 수 있어? 너한테 내 사진첩을 보여 주고 싶어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Samstag <b>kann</b> ich leider nicht kommen. Ich habe Fieber. Meine Ärztin sagt, ich <b>soll</b> zwei Tage zu Hause bleiben. <b>Kannst</b> du am Sonntag kommen? Ich <b>möchte</b> dir mein Fotoalbum zeigen.</div>아파서 못 가는 것은 가능성 — kann.<br>의사가 시킨 일 — soll. 의문문의 du — Kannst.<br>정중한 바람 — möchte.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;darf&quot;],[&quot;muss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> In der Ausstellung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen · müssen 중 하나)</span> man nicht essen. Der Eintritt ist frei, man <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen · müssen 중 하나)</span> nicht bezahlen.</div><div class=\"qko\">전시장에서는 음식을 먹으면 안 돼요. 입장료는 무료예요. 돈을 내지 않아도 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · In der Ausstellung <b>darf</b> man nicht essen. Der Eintritt ist frei, man <b>muss</b> nicht bezahlen.</div>첫 문장은 금지라서 nicht dürfen — man darf nicht essen.<br>둘째 문장은 필요 없음이라서 nicht müssen — man muss nicht bezahlen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Doch&quot;],[&quot;darf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> „Darfst du heute nicht kommen?“ – „<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Ja · Nein · Doch)</span>, ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen)</span> kommen!“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;너 오늘 오면 안 돼?&quot; – &quot;아니, 가도 돼!&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „Darfst du heute nicht kommen?“ – „<b>Doch</b>, ich <b>darf</b> kommen!“</div>부정 질문에 반대로 답할 때는 Doch예요(9과).<br>허락이니까 dürfen, ich → darf.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Unsere Kinder dürfen abends keine Süßigkeiten essen.&quot;,&quot;Abends dürfen unsere Kinder keine Süßigkeiten essen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 아이들은 저녁에는 단것을 먹으면 안 돼요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">dürfen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Unsere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Kinder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">abends</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">keine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Süßigkeiten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">essen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Unsere Kinder dürfen abends keine Süßigkeiten essen.</b></div>dürfen이 두 번째 자리, essen이 맨 끝이에요.<br>명사를 부정하는 keine는 명사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> '너는 오늘 밤에 혼자 운전하면 안 돼.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Heute Abend dürfst du nicht allein fahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Heute Abend darfst du nicht allein fahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Heute Abend musst du nicht allein fahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Heute Abend du darfst nicht allein fahren.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Heute Abend가 첫 자리라서 화법조동사가 두 번째, 주어는 그 뒤예요.<br>금지는 nicht dürfen, du → darfst. musst du nicht는 '안 해도 돼'예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"